               checkout, so the header's entry is replaced with the 0.0.5
               tarball above under the name `ws`; and the file gains one `##`
               line above its header, because that line is the title
               `list_roc_index(kind: "examples")` prints. Nothing else differs.
topics/     <- this package's own, not upstream's: programs written against
               this pin. ws_client and ws_server use the roc-basic-cli-websocket
               adapter (below) and were run against each other, under both
               nightly-2026-11-03-34bd006 and nightly-2026-10-12-2664a27.
               ws_adapters and ws_frames use no platform I/O.
overview.md <- this package's own. Every API claim on it was compiled, and every
