# Related packages, the platform adapters the overview documents. Changes of the
# newest releases: roc-basic-cli-websocket 0.0.3 makes `receive_within!` a total
# deadline (0.0.2 bounded each read, so a peer pinging every second kept it
# waiting) and adds a `deadline` field to `WsClient.Link` and `WsServer.Link`,
# which only code that builds a link by hand sees; roc-basic-webserver-websocket
# 0.0.2 moves to roc-websocket 0.0.5 and documents what bounds time, with no API
# change.
